        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A lot has changed in the 40 years since I first launched Dell from a University of Texas dorm room, but what hasn't changed is our commitment to creating technology that drives human progress. In fact, our mission is more powerful and important than ever.",
            "block_bbox": [
