        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "We need to work together to ensure AI lives up to its potential by encouraging responsible use and ensuring its application is as beneficial to people and our planet as possible. The evolving regulatory environment is on the minds of our customers, partners, suppliers and investors.\nSustainability and ESG commitments are now widely recognized as business imperatives that impact everything from supplier decisions to business strategy. At Dell, we are both meeting our goals and helping customers meet theirs.",
            "block_bbox": [
